  ('368e1af1-4320-540c-9976-ea8131b4398a'::uuid,1,'Nnamdi’s retained copy bears the deceased’s thumbprint and divides the estate, while Chuka’s version contains the land buyer’s invented parcel.','nnamdi''s retained copy bears the deceased''s thumbprint and divides the estate while chuka''s version contains the land buyer''s invented parcel','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
