  ('ad8f463d-70b1-56e0-86a0-c8d6d6fc96da'::uuid,1,'What would I notice first when entering somebody’s home? — How clean it feels / The way it smells / How comfortable the seating looks / The personal details around the room','what would i notice first when entering somebody''s home how clean it feels the way it smells how comfortable the seating looks the personal details around the room','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('5e23d5e3-9200-59f9-9490-4ffba29a21fb'::uuid,1,'How am I most likely to handle several errands in one day? — Plan the most efficient route / Do the easiest ones first / Start with the most urgent / Complete a few and postpone the rest','how am i most likely to handle several errands in one day plan the most efficient route do the easiest ones first start with the most urgent complete a few and postpone the rest','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('58773774-9efc-548d-b298-73d65a06059b'::uuid,1,'What makes me feel that a weekday was genuinely productive? — I finished the hardest task / I cleared several small tasks / I made progress without feeling exhausted / I still had energy for my personal life','what makes me feel that a weekday was genuinely productive i finished the hardest task i cleared several small tasks i made progress without feeling exhausted i still had energy for my personal life','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('e042d460-6c79-5dee-8d4a-70d8d4a470cc'::uuid,1,'If my alarm failed, what would upset me most? — Missing an important commitment / Having to rush through everything / Looking unreliable to somebody / Losing the calm start I expected','if my alarm failed what would upset me most missing an important commitment having to rush through everything looking unreliable to somebody losing the calm start i expected','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('ff92ffd7-1cf3-5402-b657-3ca96755d54f'::uuid,1,'Which kind of background sound helps me concentrate best? — Music without lyrics / A familiar show playing quietly / Normal café or street noise / Complete silence','which kind of background sound helps me concentrate best music without lyrics a familiar show playing quietly normal caf or street noise complete silence','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('5d686c5e-2716-5b20-b915-5be09cea5484'::uuid,1,'What do I usually do when I cannot decide what to wear? — Return to a reliable favourite / Ask somebody for an opinion / Try on too many options / Choose whatever is most comfortable','what do i usually do when i cannot decide what to wear return to a reliable favourite ask somebody for an opinion try on too many options choose whatever is most comfortable','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('31c6f0c2-4100-588f-85c2-c4baca834bd6'::uuid,1,'If I found unexpected money in an old bag, what would I do with it? — Buy myself a small treat / Put it back into savings / Use it for something practical / Forget it counts and spend it casually','if i found unexpected money in an old bag what would i do with it buy myself a small treat put it back into savings use it for something practical forget it counts and spend it casually','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('8450f7f9-2b1f-51b3-8e78-eea2423e1a1d'::uuid,1,'What would make me enjoy cooking on an ordinary day? — Having plenty of time / Cooking with somebody / Trying a recipe that excites me / Knowing somebody else will clean up','what would make me enjoy cooking on an ordinary day having plenty of time cooking with somebody trying a recipe that excites me knowing somebody else will clean up','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('4aaca581-c3c2-577c-a34e-80d2ae9319a9'::uuid,1,'When I am tired but still have work left, what keeps me going? — A strict deadline / A promise of rest afterwards / Somebody depending on me / Wanting tomorrow to feel easier','when i am tired but still have work left what keeps me going a strict deadline a promise of rest afterwards somebody depending on me wanting tomorrow to feel easier','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('309c59f5-dfe4-526e-aadc-2cabbc13c7c5'::uuid,1,'Which part of travelling across town would I plan most carefully? — The exact time to leave / The fastest route / How much the trip will cost / What I need to carry','which part of travelling across town would i plan most carefully the exact time to leave the fastest route how much the trip will cost what i need to carry','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('17dc9744-932c-5207-b0ff-cea10861c7d0'::uuid,1,'If somebody borrowed a household item and forgot to return it, what would I do? — Ask for it directly / Send a playful reminder / Wait until I actually need it / Quietly decide not to lend again','if somebody borrowed a household item and forgot to return it what would i do ask for it directly send a playful reminder wait until i actually need it quietly decide not to lend again','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('d641ef38-c591-51e1-851e-652000926f4f'::uuid,1,'What is my strongest sign that I need a proper break? — Small tasks start irritating me / I keep making simple mistakes / I stop replying to people / Rest no longer feels refreshing','what is my strongest sign that i need a proper break small tasks start irritating me i keep making simple mistakes i stop replying to people rest no longer feels refreshing','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('fc9012dc-d9d2-5a10-9a06-0540c96ac4e2'::uuid,1,'How would I react to an unexpected day without internet? — Enjoy being unreachable / Find another connection immediately / Complete offline tasks / Complain until service returns','how would i react to an unexpected day without internet enjoy being unreachable find another connection immediately complete offline tasks complain until service returns','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('b4940d5f-d34b-527f-9087-c5d1662031e9'::uuid,1,'What usually determines where I sit in a room? — Being close to people I know / Having a clear view of everything / Finding the most comfortable seat / Staying near an easy exit','what usually determines where i sit in a room being close to people i know having a clear view of everything finding the most comfortable seat staying near an easy exit','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('40d30730-4b84-5722-a295-d4b0a61106e4'::uuid,1,'Which tiny achievement gives me disproportionate satisfaction? — Clearing every notification / Finishing something before the deadline / Finding exactly what I needed on sale / Organising a space perfectly','which tiny achievement gives me disproportionate satisfaction clearing every notification finishing something before the deadline finding exactly what i needed on sale organising a space perfectly','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('4689b245-e369-53a3-8ad0-db4b6960960e'::uuid,1,'If I had to leave home in five minutes, what would I check last? — My phone battery / Whether I have my keys / How I look / The weather or traffic','if i had to leave home in five minutes what would i check last my phone battery whether i have my keys how i look the weather or traffic','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('f24a756d-bd47-5776-9ab4-07595103bedb'::uuid,1,'What would I do with food that arrived different from what I ordered? — Ask for the correct order / Eat it if it still looks good / Complain but keep it / Offer it to somebody else','what would i do with food that arrived different from what i ordered ask for the correct order eat it if it still looks good complain but keep it offer it to somebody else','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('5c98e955-6c65-5d7a-a01b-da2d45de93a5'::uuid,1,'When a day starts badly, how do I usually reset it? — Take a shower and begin again / Get one useful task done / Call somebody who improves my mood / Accept the day and lower my expectations','when a day starts badly how do i usually reset it take a shower and begin again get one useful task done call somebody who improves my mood accept the day and lower my expectations','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import')
