  ('537511a4-6a0b-50c2-a6f1-d0b6927527fd'::uuid,1,'Which board-game responsibility would I accept? — Explaining the rules clearly / Keeping score without losing track / Setting up every piece correctly / Making sure quiet players get turns','which board game responsibility would i accept explaining the rules clearly keeping score without losing track setting up every piece correctly making sure quiet players get turns','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('4f8af69e-e488-5b54-8f91-45815500fe19'::uuid,1,'How would I feel about a surprise ticket to an unknown show? — Excited by the mystery / Curious after checking a few details / Nervous about the time commitment / Grateful but wishing I had chosen','how would i feel about a surprise ticket to an unknown show excited by the mystery curious after checking a few details nervous about the time commitment grateful but wishing i had chosen','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('10e0f66e-e90f-5f79-8bd9-b04b7f310c19'::uuid,1,'What kind of creative risk earns my respect even if it fails? — An unusual structure that asks for attention / A performer showing an unfamiliar side / A story refusing an easy happy ending / A small project attempting a huge idea','what kind of creative risk earns my respect even if it fails an unusual structure that asks for attention a performer showing an unfamiliar side a story refusing an easy happy ending a small project attempting a huge idea','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('1b396b4e-79eb-52a5-908b-20fe240b2d39'::uuid,1,'Which fictional mentor would appeal to me most? — The strict teacher who sees hidden potential / The patient guide who asks good questions / The flawed expert learning alongside the hero / The eccentric mentor with unusual methods','which fictional mentor would appeal to me most the strict teacher who sees hidden potential the patient guide who asks good questions the flawed expert learning alongside the hero the eccentric mentor with unusual methods','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('889cd442-0917-530d-b944-15009f67b1f9'::uuid,1,'What would I notice first at a beautifully designed event? — How lighting changes the space / The music shaping everyone’s mood / Small details tying the theme together / How easily guests can move and participate','what would i notice first at a beautifully designed event how lighting changes the space the music shaping everyone''s mood small details tying the theme together how easily guests can move and participate','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('da3c22ab-9e07-520d-b303-58143c632444'::uuid,1,'If I could hear one album again for the first time, why choose it? — Every song created a complete journey / It arrived during an important period / Its sound surprised me immediately / I discovered its best details too gradually','if i could hear one album again for the first time why choose it every song created a complete journey it arrived during an important period its sound surprised me immediately i discovered its best details too gradually','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import')
