  ('fe0d941e-3762-506d-abb0-a2379c1bf170'::uuid,1,'What makes a fictional apology convincing to me? — The person names exactly what they did / Their behaviour changes before they ask forgiveness / They accept that repair may be refused / The words fit the character instead of sounding perfect','what makes a fictional apology convincing to me the person names exactly what they did their behaviour changes before they ask forgiveness they accept that repair may be refused the words fit the character instead of sounding perfect','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('46e6ce8a-e3a5-5165-a3a8-a454be7d35fe'::uuid,1,'Which type of game character would I create first? — A clever strategist with unusual tools / A powerful protector who helps the team / A fast explorer who finds hidden places / A charming rule-breaker with risky skills','which type of game character would i create first a clever strategist with unusual tools a powerful protector who helps the team a fast explorer who finds hidden places a charming rule breaker with risky skills','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('7a0d2e7e-bf76-527b-bfa0-4f4e4b778273'::uuid,1,'If a song sampled an old favourite, what would please me most? — Recognising it only after several seconds / Hearing the original artist involved / The sample gaining a completely new meaning / A new generation discovering the source','if a song sampled an old favourite what would please me most recognising it only after several seconds hearing the original artist involved the sample gaining a completely new meaning a new generation discovering the source','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('dec45c27-3667-5678-abd4-393817254a0b'::uuid,1,'What would make me keep a ticket stub for years? — It marked a personal first / Someone important attended with me / The event exceeded every expectation / The ticket itself has a beautiful design','what would make me keep a ticket stub for years it marked a personal first someone important attended with me the event exceeded every expectation the ticket itself has a beautiful design','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('49deab09-cafb-5133-880e-f359e55411bf'::uuid,1,'Which kind of fictional secret creates the best tension? — One the audience knows before the characters / One shared by two people who no longer trust / One protecting someone for the wrong reason / One that becomes harder to reveal each day','which kind of fictional secret creates the best tension one the audience knows before the characters one shared by two people who no longer trust one protecting someone for the wrong reason one that becomes harder to reveal each day','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('794bbb7f-eee2-511b-804d-217ad3560856'::uuid,1,'How would I react to a live show starting an hour late? — Enjoy it if updates and a reason are given / Expect compensation for the delay / Lose enthusiasm before it begins / Use the extra time to socialise','how would i react to a live show starting an hour late enjoy it if updates and a reason are given expect compensation for the delay lose enthusiasm before it begins use the extra time to socialise','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
