  ('40e44f2d-603e-57e9-8e0e-ba8305733ad2'::uuid,1,'Which kind of fictional pet would I choose as a companion? — A loyal creature able to sense danger / A tiny troublemaker with hidden powers / A wise animal that communicates indirectly / A rare creature nobody fully understands','which kind of fictional pet would i choose as a companion a loyal creature able to sense danger a tiny troublemaker with hidden powers a wise animal that communicates indirectly a rare creature nobody fully understands','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
