  ('fc843657-164b-5866-b8e7-e96f5f9cb485'::uuid,1,'Which kind of team challenge would I enjoy on television? — Building something that must actually work / Solving a mystery across several locations / Creating a performance in one day / Completing a journey with limited resources','which kind of team challenge would i enjoy on television building something that must actually work solving a mystery across several locations creating a performance in one day completing a journey with limited resources','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('10908f5d-9439-5810-9867-490a8adddc0f'::uuid,1,'How would I prefer a favourite franchise to end? — With one planned and satisfying conclusion / While the world still feels exciting / After giving every major character closure / With room for imagination but no required sequel','how would i prefer a favourite franchise to end with one planned and satisfying conclusion while the world still feels exciting after giving every major character closure with room for imagination but no required sequel','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
