  ('1b4d9640-b3c3-5be8-9ade-192e778d84bc'::uuid,1,'Which moment makes a live match unforgettable? — A decision changing in the final seconds / A crowd honouring an exceptional opponent / A substitute becoming the unexpected hero / A player returning after a serious setback','which moment makes a live match unforgettable a decision changing in the final seconds a crowd honouring an exceptional opponent a substitute becoming the unexpected hero a player returning after a serious setback','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
