  ('c09024ca-f81a-5cf1-b28b-80bff662daee'::uuid,1,'What would make a children’s story enjoyable to me as an adult? — Humour working differently for each age / A sincere theme without talking down / Beautiful craft in the art or animation / Characters whose feelings remain recognisable','what would make a children''s story enjoyable to me as an adult humour working differently for each age a sincere theme without talking down beautiful craft in the art or animation characters whose feelings remain recognisable','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
