  ('8758bdab-a427-5722-b006-e2ea21144ff3'::uuid,1,'Which kind of Nigerian market shopper am I? — Compare several sellers before buying / Return to one seller I already trust / Negotiate confidently and enjoy the exchange / Get what I need quickly and leave','which kind of nigerian market shopper am i compare several sellers before buying return to one seller i already trust negotiate confidently and enjoy the exchange get what i need quickly and leave','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
